Extreme cold has gripped the continent and the ocean after an energy blast in Gallubia Valley and at the bottom of the sea.
In the War of the Worlds, while we searched for the Legendary Trident, Yagditha used the Snow Lady to attack the surface and made the Abyssal Armor from the Magic Crystals to equip his troops. He betrayed her, letting her be defeated by the silver fire of the Royal Mages and Shamans.
The Snow Lady took refuge in Snowstorm Valley with the Snow Tribe. Betrayed once again, she swore revenge.

I will need help. I will create the Sphere of Fire to cover everything from the continent to the bottom of the sea.
Wait a little until the Sphere of Fire is summoned.

Use the time to check your potions; I will be waiting for you.
